  obtainSource: 1
  obtainNote: "\u0E40\u0E0A\u0E1F\u0E40\u0E21\u0E47\u0E01\u0E0B\u0E34\u0E01\u0E31\u0E19"
  mailShopLevel: 2
  mailReputation: 1300
  chef: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd96477d5695e8349a71dcd12e8bd8d2, type: 2}
  letterBody: "Hola again,\n\nRosa here. My grandson says your little shop has many
    reviews now. Qu\xE9 bien!\n\nEnchiladas are what I cook for big family Sundays.
    Twenty people, three generations, everyone arguing and laughing. When I was young,
    I wanted quiet. Now that my house is quiet, I miss the noise.\n\nRoll chicken
    in warm tortillas, cover with red chili sauce and cheese, and bake until it bubbles.\n\nYou
    don't have to love crowds. But leave a little room at your table, just in case."
